08032F14 scroll-reset-return

TextState_Reset pops its return address into r0. ScrollingDialogue_ResetPlayback
uses r1 to return and leaves that Thumb return address in r0.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/scrolling_dialogue.c
+++ b/src/scrolling_dialogue.c
@@ -28,4 +28,7 @@
     text->wrap = 2;
     TextState_Reset(text);
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return 0x08032F6D; // preserve the inherited GBA return value
+#endif
 }
 
